WEBVTT

00:00:04.192 --> 00:00:05.693
Sorey...

00:00:05.902 --> 00:00:07.904
Are you the Shepherd?

00:00:08.112 --> 00:00:09.781
Huh?

00:00:09.989 --> 00:00:12.992
I'm just a regular human.

00:00:13.201 --> 00:00:15.370
Not... the Shepherd?

00:00:15.578 --> 00:00:16.704
No.

00:00:16.913 --> 00:00:21.876
You're human too, right?
This is the first time a human came up here.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:28.007
In that case, this must be the shrine
known as the Capital of Seraphim, correct?

00:00:28.216 --> 00:00:28.758
Yeah.

00:00:28.967 --> 00:00:32.512
So shouldn't the Shepherd be here?

00:00:34.472 --> 00:00:38.059
| found nobody. But I did find a mural.

00:00:38.268 --> 00:00:40.603
The Shepherd raising the holy blade...

00:00:40.812 --> 00:00:42.355
A mural...?

00:00:42.564 --> 00:00:46.317
So it seems it was just a legend after all...

00:00:46.526 --> 00:00:50.113
The world can no longer be saved.

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:18.600
The path you take extends far in the distance

00:01:18.808 --> 00:01:21.936
The wind's on our side, let's go

00:01:22.145 --> 00:01:28.735
The answers we seek won't be easy to find,

00:01:28.943 --> 00:01:33.406
But we knew that before we set out

00:01:34.657 --> 00:01:42.665
The footprints in our dreams
never lead in a straight path

00:01:42.874 --> 00:01:47.920
Adding as we go, our world map keeps growing

00:01:48.129 --> 00:01:50.673
Resonate, song of the wind

00:01:50.882 --> 00:01:55.720
Even with closed eyes,
our hearts push us forward

00:01:55.928 --> 00:02:01.434
The clouds we aim for are further, higher

00:02:01.643 --> 00:02:04.187
Reach out, song of the wind

00:02:04.395 --> 00:02:09.275
Listen carefully and hear the voice
of our hearts bellowing

00:02:09.484 --> 00:02:14.447
Shine like a brilliant light

00:02:14.656 --> 00:02:18.201
You, become a blue melody

00:02:27.126 --> 00:02:30.546
You're going to get in trouble
for letting a human in.

00:02:30.755 --> 00:02:34.884
Whoever it is, I can't ignore
a person who needs help.

00:02:35.093 --> 00:02:41.307
Don't you think it's strange that
she won't even tell you her name?

00:02:41.516 --> 00:02:45.645
She must have her reasons.
But she doesn't seem like a bad person.

00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:53.653
Sorey, I thank you.

00:02:53.861 --> 00:02:56.614
Don't worry about it.

00:02:56.823 --> 00:03:00.952
Be prepared to face the wrath of Gramps.

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:01.994
Is something wrong?

00:03:02.203 --> 00:03:05.790
No, it's nothing. Let's go!

00:03:05.998 --> 00:03:10.878
| guess she really can't see me.
Just like Gramps said.

00:03:11.963 --> 00:03:18.803
"Chapter 2 - Elysia"

00:03:22.557 --> 00:03:24.892
What beauty...

00:03:25.101 --> 00:03:27.687
So this is truly home of the Seraphim...

00:03:27.895 --> 00:03:31.107
So you really call them Seraphim?

00:03:31.315 --> 00:03:33.985
Is something wrong?

00:03:34.193 --> 00:03:35.278
No.

00:03:36.738 --> 00:03:41.993
Gods, spirits, monsters...
Humans, through reverent fear,

00:03:42.201 --> 00:03:46.122
call those shapeless
supernatural beings "Seraphim."”

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:47.415
Right?

00:03:47.623 --> 00:03:51.544
So you read the Celestial Record too!

00:03:51.753 --> 00:03:54.380
Too? So you mean...

00:03:54.589 --> 00:04:00.595
Sorey, tell me. What is the name
of the village that you live in?

00:04:00.803 --> 00:04:03.681
It's, uh, Elysia.

00:04:03.890 --> 00:04:04.974
Elysia...!

00:04:15.568 --> 00:04:17.612
I'm going to report to Gramps.

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:21.032
| guess we can't just be quiet about it.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:22.950
You're coming later, right?

00:04:35.963 --> 00:04:38.007
Hey everyone, I'd like to introduce...

00:04:38.216 --> 00:04:44.639
Seraphim! If you are here, please heed my words!

00:04:44.847 --> 00:04:53.564
As prophesized, the world is about to be...
No, the world is enshrouded by darkness!

00:04:53.773 --> 00:04:58.611
To save the world,
we need your help, Seraphim!

00:04:58.820 --> 00:05:03.866
Please, lend me your aid! Respond to my call!

00:05:04.075 --> 00:05:06.702
| beg you, Seraphim!

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:11.290
Please, answer me...

00:05:18.130 --> 00:05:22.718
Sorey, she must leave,
before she invites disaster.

00:05:28.391 --> 00:05:30.685
You idiot!

00:05:30.893 --> 00:05:34.105
Why did you bring the human into our lands?!

00:05:34.313 --> 00:05:38.651
Gramps, you promised
to listen to Sorey's argument.

00:05:40.194 --> 00:05:46.409
Sorey. You knew the rules.
Why did you break them?

00:05:46.617 --> 00:05:49.620
| couldn't just leave her.

00:05:51.455 --> 00:05:54.709
What you have already done cannot be undone.

00:05:54.917 --> 00:05:59.505
However, you must send her back
to the realm below, at once.

00:05:59.714 --> 00:06:02.800
For the peace of all who live here, you must.

00:06:03.009 --> 00:06:07.179
Humans only bring disaster to our lands.

00:06:07.388 --> 00:06:10.308
But I'm human too.

00:06:10.516 --> 00:06:18.524
You have spent a long time with us and
acquired the ability to see us and speak with us.

00:06:18.733 --> 00:06:25.823
No ordinary human can do this.
You must understand this key difference.

00:06:26.032 --> 00:06:30.828
Then why did you give me
the Celestial Record, Gramps?

00:06:31.037 --> 00:06:32.747
What...?

00:06:32.955 --> 00:06:41.213
The book said, in the past,
Seraphim and humans lived together happily.

00:06:41.422 --> 00:06:43.382
That was then, and...

00:06:43.591 --> 00:06:46.761
Besides, she believes in the Seraphim.

00:06:57.396 --> 00:06:59.732
I'm sorry I startled you this afternoon.

00:06:59.941 --> 00:07:00.942
Huh?

00:07:01.525 --> 00:07:06.364
Trying to speak to thin air, as if the
Seraphim actually exist... That was crazy.

00:07:06.572 --> 00:07:08.491
Well, um...

00:07:11.911 --> 00:07:15.206
What's it like where you're from?

00:07:15.414 --> 00:07:16.415
The capital...

00:07:16.624 --> 00:07:18.334
Capital...?

00:07:18.542 --> 00:07:21.796
It's Ladylake, capital of Hyland.

00:07:22.004 --> 00:07:26.926
Ladylake? Isn't that where the legend
of the Sacred Blade takes place?

00:07:27.134 --> 00:07:32.098
The one who pulls out the blade, protected by
the Lady of the Lake, becomes the Shepherd?

00:07:32.306 --> 00:07:38.020
Yes. But nobody has ever
pulled the Sacred Blade out.

00:07:52.368 --> 00:07:54.787
Mikleo! How long have you been out here?

00:07:56.414 --> 00:07:58.499
Gramps sent a message.

00:07:58.708 --> 00:08:02.128
"It's unknown when the human
will cause a disaster.

00:08:02.336 --> 00:08:10.302
However, chasing her out and
provoking a disaster is also unwise.

00:08:10.511 --> 00:08:15.349
Therefore, I will wait
until she is ready to leave."

00:08:15.558 --> 00:08:17.435
End message.

00:08:17.643 --> 00:08:19.729
Tell Gramps I said thanks!

00:08:21.147 --> 00:08:23.482
Thank you too, Mikleo!

00:08:32.366 --> 00:08:37.997
| know, Mikleo. He is honest and just.

00:08:38.205 --> 00:08:42.084
That is exactly why I am worried.

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:57.475
Here |I go...

00:09:00.144 --> 00:09:01.437
Got it!

00:09:03.064 --> 00:09:06.317
So have you lived like this your whole life?

00:09:06.525 --> 00:09:10.112
Yeah. I've never been out of this town.

00:09:10.321 --> 00:09:14.700
Sorey, it must have been difficult for you.

00:09:17.453 --> 00:09:18.287
What's wrong?

00:09:18.496 --> 00:09:24.043
Well... It felt like I was being watched.

00:09:24.251 --> 00:09:28.672
Maybe someone wants to know more about you.

00:09:30.966 --> 00:09:37.056
You don't have to play along.
You're trying to suggest the Seraphim are here.

00:10:05.376 --> 00:10:06.794
Are you feeling better?

00:10:07.002 --> 00:10:10.381
Thank you. I'm fine now.

00:10:10.589 --> 00:10:11.841
Good.

00:10:13.926 --> 00:10:15.302
The Celestial Record?

00:10:15.511 --> 00:10:20.099
Yeah. I've read it many times over,
from when I was a kid.

00:10:20.307 --> 00:10:24.395
My dream is to travel
the world to visit the ruins.

00:10:24.603 --> 00:10:28.149
Most of the readers of
the Celestial Record say that.

00:10:28.357 --> 00:10:31.068
I'm just one of many...

00:10:31.277 --> 00:10:37.491
But this world is not in any state
to be wandered around in.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:42.746
For a while now, the world has been
subjected to incomprehensible calamities.

00:10:42.955 --> 00:10:44.373
Calamities?

00:10:44.582 --> 00:10:50.087
| also experienced a terrible calamity,
that I still have trouble believing.

00:10:50.296 --> 00:10:52.381
You did?

00:10:52.590 --> 00:10:59.054
Many lives were taken as I watched,
including my friends.

00:11:00.514 --> 00:11:04.059
Memories of that scene
are still fresh in my mind.

00:11:05.019 --> 00:11:12.234
So... When darkness engulfs the world,
the Shepherd appears to restore the light...

00:11:13.194 --> 00:11:16.864
You're here to find the Shepherd.

00:11:17.072 --> 00:11:22.369
Yes. The legends are
the only things I have left.

00:11:22.578 --> 00:11:25.039
But now that I'm here, I learned...

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:33.380
Legends are just fairy tales.

00:12:09.124 --> 00:12:10.876
Mikleo!

00:12:11.085 --> 00:12:12.586
Sorey?

00:12:14.588 --> 00:12:18.634
Mikleo, I need it back, please!

00:12:18.842 --> 00:12:20.678
I-1t?

00:12:37.653 --> 00:12:39.196
Is this...?

00:12:40.572 --> 00:12:41.991
Gramps.

00:12:50.249 --> 00:12:51.875
Over here!

00:13:02.136 --> 00:13:03.637
Is this...?

00:13:03.846 --> 00:13:06.181
Cool, huh?

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:11.061
| have never seen one so impressive...

00:13:11.270 --> 00:13:17.526
Who would go out of their way to build such an
impressive thing in the sky for a mere fairy tale?

00:13:17.735 --> 00:13:20.696
Not to mention the awesome temple!

00:13:20.904 --> 00:13:22.114
Sorey...

00:13:22.323 --> 00:13:24.408
| found this here, too.

00:13:26.744 --> 00:13:29.204
Mark of the Shepherd!

00:13:29.413 --> 00:13:35.753
The Shepherd did exist!
It's not just a fairy tale!

00:13:42.843 --> 00:13:50.225
If the world below is being engulfed in
darkness like you said, the Shepherd will arrive.

00:13:50.434 --> 00:13:52.269
| just know it.

00:13:53.395 --> 00:13:58.692
You believe in the Celestial Record.

00:13:58.901 --> 00:14:00.611
| do.

00:14:01.862 --> 00:14:07.159
My dream is to let humans and Seraphim
live together happily again.

00:14:07.368 --> 00:14:12.414
| really believe that a
great world like that is coming.

00:14:12.623 --> 00:14:14.625
You should take this.

00:14:16.126 --> 00:14:18.921
The Shepherd will come.

00:14:23.258 --> 00:14:25.302
Thank you, Sorey.

00:14:25.511 --> 00:14:27.137
| will believe it too.

00:14:27.346 --> 00:14:31.892
That someone will pull out the Sacred Blade
protected by the Lady of the Lake...

00:14:46.782 --> 00:14:48.659
Are you sure you can travel alone from here?

00:14:48.867 --> 00:14:49.952
Yes.

00:14:50.160 --> 00:14:51.620
Okay.

00:14:51.829 --> 00:14:55.165
Sorey, you have truly been a great help.

00:15:03.799 --> 00:15:04.925
Alisha.

00:15:05.134 --> 00:15:06.510
Huh?

00:15:06.718 --> 00:15:10.139
My name is Alisha Diphda.

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:16.603
You helped me, without knowing
who I am, without even asking.

00:15:16.812 --> 00:15:23.068
Me, on the other hand...
It was shameful of me, as a knight.

00:15:23.277 --> 00:15:26.029
| humbly beg for your forgiveness.

00:15:26.238 --> 00:15:28.699
D-Don't mention it!

00:15:28.907 --> 00:15:32.995
| have to apologize about one more thing.

00:15:40.878 --> 00:15:43.714
| think there are Seraphim in Elysia.

00:15:44.965 --> 00:15:46.633
Alisha...!

00:15:46.842 --> 00:15:52.890
They did not respond to my words,
but I did feel their invisible presence.

00:15:53.974 --> 00:15:57.853
To tell you the truth, I feel it now.

00:15:59.646 --> 00:16:03.400
The Sacred Blade Festival
is starting in Ladylake soon.

00:16:03.609 --> 00:16:07.988
The Trial of the Blade, as depicted in the
legend of the Shepherd, will be done too.

00:16:09.114 --> 00:16:13.911
Sorey... Are you interested in taking the Trial?

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:18.707
Also...

00:16:18.916 --> 00:16:22.085
You should hold on to this.

00:16:22.294 --> 00:16:23.712
Why?

00:16:23.921 --> 00:16:29.384
You said yesterday that your dream is
to allow humans and Seraphim to live together.

00:16:29.593 --> 00:16:30.469
Yeah.

00:16:30.677 --> 00:16:38.685
The Shepherd of legend...
| think he was someone like you.

00:16:41.146 --> 00:16:42.606
| will take my leave.

00:16:51.365 --> 00:16:52.449
Sorey...!

00:16:55.661 --> 00:16:56.328
Gramps?

00:16:56.537 --> 00:16:59.915
Someone has invaded my domain!

00:17:02.876 --> 00:17:05.420
The intruder masks his presence.

00:17:05.629 --> 00:17:12.094
Listen, everyone! There is an intruder!
Possibly a Hellion!

00:17:12.302 --> 00:17:14.471
Search, and be ready!

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:15.722
Let's go!

00:17:15.931 --> 00:17:17.015
Yeah!

00:17:29.987 --> 00:17:30.404
Sorey!

00:17:30.612 --> 00:17:32.030
Let's hurry!

00:17:42.499 --> 00:17:44.167
Mason!

00:17:45.127 --> 00:17:48.297
How odd...

00:17:50.757 --> 00:17:55.345
Only the main course was supposed to be here.

00:17:55.554 --> 00:17:59.600
And now there are two more?

00:17:59.808 --> 00:18:01.059
A Hellion?!

00:18:01.268 --> 00:18:05.314
This is no place for you. Leave now!

00:18:08.567 --> 00:18:14.156
Insolent little brat...
Do you want to end up like this one?

00:18:15.657 --> 00:18:17.492
How dare you!

00:18:44.895 --> 00:18:47.606
Water, pierce the enemy!

00:18:51.109 --> 00:18:52.569
Sorey, stand back!

00:19:16.259 --> 00:19:17.886
He's not hurt?

00:19:23.558 --> 00:19:24.643
Gramps!

00:19:26.019 --> 00:19:29.189
Be gone, evil one.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:42.953
Heh. I guess it wouldn't be good to waste time
on you and let the main course get away.

00:19:47.165 --> 00:19:49.793
Sorry, Gramps...

00:19:50.001 --> 00:19:54.631
| brought the human to Elysia,
and now that thing...

00:19:54.840 --> 00:20:00.887
No. That Hellion is neither
your responsibility nor hers.

00:20:01.096 --> 00:20:03.306
Mikleo is correct.

00:20:03.515 --> 00:20:04.766
Gramps...

00:20:04.975 --> 00:20:12.733
Perhaps keeping that girl away may have
prevented that evil one from entering this realm.

00:20:12.941 --> 00:20:19.614
But that is a selfish thought, that one's
own safety is the only thing that matters.

00:20:20.490 --> 00:20:24.828
The peace in this realm is connected
to the outside world as well.

00:20:25.036 --> 00:20:29.249
We must not ignore this.

00:20:37.299 --> 00:20:38.467
That guy...

00:20:43.889 --> 00:20:47.851
It wouldn't be good to waste time on you
and let the main course get away.

00:20:50.061 --> 00:20:55.108
What if he showed up here
not because a human entered Elysia...

00:20:56.067 --> 00:20:58.403
...but because he was after Alisha?

00:21:04.201 --> 00:21:08.914
| guess everyone's going to be mad
to know I left without saying anything.

00:21:09.122 --> 00:21:10.832
Sorry, guys!

00:21:12.083 --> 00:21:13.293
Okay!

00:21:13.502 --> 00:21:15.003
Not okay.

00:21:15.212 --> 00:21:16.713
Huh?

00:21:16.922 --> 00:21:18.965
Mikleo, how...?!

00:21:19.174 --> 00:21:23.386
Thought I'd let you duck out of here?

00:21:23.595 --> 00:21:24.763
Mikleo!

00:21:24.971 --> 00:21:30.519
From what that fox man said,
it's fair to assume that he's after Alisha.

00:21:30.727 --> 00:21:32.604
You picked up on that too, huh?

00:21:32.813 --> 00:21:35.357
Of course. Look.

00:21:36.733 --> 00:21:38.151
What's this?

00:21:38.360 --> 00:21:43.949
Gramps sent me back to the ruins
to find clues about Alisha.

00:21:44.157 --> 00:21:46.243
That's the symbol of the
royal family of Hyland.

00:21:46.451 --> 00:21:50.997
Alisha Diphda... She is no ordinary knight.

00:21:51.206 --> 00:21:54.918
Let's use this as a clue
to find Alisha in Ladylake.

00:21:55.126 --> 00:21:56.211
--You probably had no plan to...

00:21:56.211 --> 00:21:57.921
--Mikleo!
--You probably had no plan to...

00:21:58.129 --> 00:22:00.882
I'm so glad you came!

00:22:01.091 --> 00:22:06.721
| couldn't let you navigate the world
of humans alone. Not as guileless as you are.

00:22:11.101 --> 00:22:13.520
| bet Gramps is mad, though.

00:22:13.728 --> 00:22:15.689
Message from Gramps.

00:22:15.897 --> 00:22:19.401
"Walk the path you believe in
and live your life to the fullest,

00:22:19.609 --> 00:22:22.821
and I know you will not go astray.”

00:22:33.832 --> 00:22:35.709
Wow!

00:22:35.917 --> 00:22:38.920
This is the world!

00:22:41.089 --> 00:22:44.718
"Next episode preview"

00:22:45.135 --> 00:22:51.349
Wow, this is the capital, home of the legendary
Lady of the Lake! Look at all the people!

00:22:51.558 --> 00:22:53.476
Indeed, it's impressive.

00:22:53.685 --> 00:22:57.230
Someone's going to pull out the
Sacred Blade and become the Shepherd.

00:22:57.439 --> 00:22:58.690
| wonder what kind of person it will be?

00:22:58.899 --> 00:23:03.111
Probably a wise man of dignity, like Gramps.

00:23:03.320 --> 00:23:07.657
Or, it could be a girl, like Alisha,
that you'd never expect.

00:23:07.866 --> 00:23:09.242
Hmm. But still,

00:23:09.451 --> 00:23:14.039
| think it would have to be a person of strong
courage and body, to fight the Hellions.

00:23:14.247 --> 00:23:14.915
| guess so.

00:23:15.123 --> 00:23:17.334
For sure, not you, Sorey.

00:23:17.542 --> 00:23:19.127
I'm still a possibility!

00:23:19.336 --> 00:23:19.878
Nope.

00:23:20.086 --> 00:23:22.964
You said it! What would you do
if I turned out to be the Shepherd?

00:23:23.173 --> 00:23:26.426
Let's see... I'll make you as many
of your favorite snacks as you want.

00:23:26.635 --> 00:23:30.096
Nope. That won't settle my broken heart.

00:23:30.305 --> 00:23:31.348
Then what?

00:23:31.556 --> 00:23:33.767
You have to deliver all future
next episode previews with a funny face.

00:23:33.975 --> 00:23:34.726
Huh?!

00:23:34.935 --> 00:23:37.479
Next week, "Mikleo's Funny Face."
Look forward to it!

00:23:37.687 --> 00:23:39.814
No! It's "The Sacred Blade Festival"!
